SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50e-3
    units mol/kgw
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50e-3
    units mol/kgw
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat.sel
    -reset false
    -solution true
    -totals Ca
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Step Temp
    10 PUNCH SIM_NO, TEMP
END